  "goodToKnow": "Umrechnen means to convert figures from one unit or currency to another: Pfund in Kilo umrechnen, Euro in Dollar umrechnen. Umgerechnet means converted: umgerechnet 100 Euro. When the euro replaced the Deutsche Mark in 2002, the fixed Umrechnungskurs was 1.95583 DM, and for years many Germans kept umrechnen in their heads, calling the euro the Teuro. Separable: rechnete um, umgerechnet."
